                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is fairly decent. If you could get over the skinny weapons and sometimes easy and predictable AI, you'll actually enjoy this. It takes place in and around space, where you can carry and trade items for cash. However along the way, you can hunt down targets in bounty hunts, which are styled in a deathmatch type of gamemode, for extra cash. It may not seem like its a shooting game, but they really introduce this mode, later in the game, which was a bit unexpected, especially if anyone wants a shooting game. This game has a story. A boring cliched storyline but at least there is a story, with a good presentation that comes with it. There's NPCs in the game that are nicely modelled, even for when this game was released. The game is feeling being to age, as expected, with the time I'm typing this review.",
